base.rea
-3                     spatial dimension  ( < 0 --> generate .rea/.re2 pair)
1                      number of fields
#=======================================================================
# Quasi-2D slab (SI, m): inflow x = 0, outflow at x = 0.03 and at both y
# faces, periodic z (2 mm thick: ppiclF needs it above the filter cutoff);
# IBM cylinder D = 3 mm along z at (8 mm, 5 mm)
#=======================================================================
Box
-24  -8  -1                                          nelx,nely,nelz
0 0.03 1.                                            x0,x1,ratio
0 0.01 1.                                            y0,y1,ratio
0 0.002 1.                                          z0,z1,ratio
v  ,O  ,O  ,O  ,P  ,P                                bc's  (3 chars each!)
